1
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:05,292
This is Polymorph.

2
00:00:05,292 --> 00:00:10,559
A real 3D modelling software, built for GTA V and FiveM.

3
00:00:11,716 --> 00:00:14,505
We took the best of 3ds Max and Blender,

4
00:00:14,505 --> 00:00:16,945
and brought it together in one app.

5
00:00:16,945 --> 00:00:17,990
Nothing copied:

6
00:00:17,990 --> 00:00:20,500
just the workflows you already know.

7
00:00:21,216 --> 00:00:25,256
The modifier stack and the precise snaps you know from Max.

8
00:00:25,256 --> 00:00:29,500
The speed, the shortcuts and the right-click menus you love in

9
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:30,048
Blender.

10
00:00:30,750 --> 00:00:33,659
Extrude, bevel, bridge, clean booleans,

11
00:00:33,659 --> 00:00:37,613
and Wall Opening to cut doors and windows in seconds.

12
00:00:38,316 --> 00:00:40,384
Then texture it right there.

13
00:00:40,384 --> 00:00:43,560
Real GTA shaders, one-click UVs, sculpting,

14
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:46,884
and a full paint studio with smart materials.

15
00:00:47,583 --> 00:00:50,823
Animate it, and light it with real GTA lights.

16
00:00:51,516 --> 00:00:53,566
Build a full MLO interior.

17
00:00:53,566 --> 00:00:56,563
Draw the plan, and the rooms, portals,

18
00:00:56,563 --> 00:00:59,244
doors and frames build themselves.

19
00:00:59,950 --> 00:01:03,814
Open the whole GTA V map, and model right inside the city.

20
00:01:04,516 --> 00:01:08,188
Turn any model into a weapon, or a car, for FiveM.

21
00:01:08,883 --> 00:01:12,771
Then one key exports a FiveM resource, ready to play.

22
00:01:13,483 --> 00:01:16,423
And Polymorph is built for the AI era.

23
00:01:16,423 --> 00:01:18,435
It has its own MCP server:

24
00:01:18,435 --> 00:01:21,452
connect your AI assistant, like Claude,

25
00:01:21,452 --> 00:01:24,470
and it can drive the whole app for you.

26
00:01:24,470 --> 00:01:29,035
Create, model, check and export, all from a simple message.

27
00:01:29,983 --> 00:01:31,457
Here is an example.

28
00:01:31,457 --> 00:01:36,657
Make a 3D world in Marble, by World Labs, and export it as a splat.

29
00:01:36,657 --> 00:01:39,529
In Polymorph, click Scan and open it.

30
00:01:39,529 --> 00:01:44,263
Click Scan again to copy the prompt, and paste it to your AI.

31
00:01:45,016 --> 00:01:48,373
The AI levels the scan, gives it its real size,

32
00:01:48,373 --> 00:01:52,944
models the block-out piece by piece, then rebuilds a clean room,

33
00:01:52,944 --> 00:01:53,944
ready for GTA.

34
00:01:54,800 --> 00:01:55,597
Polymorph.

35
00:01:55,597 --> 00:01:56,635
Free forever.

36
00:01:56,635 --> 00:02:00,704
Download it now, and join the community on Discord.

